# SUPERSEDED 2026-08-30, kept as a record. A sketch of the deck form built on @term/base's record system.
# The live design is `code/deck.tree`: `form deck` and the deck-* family as plain stdlib forms. Names are
# package-global, so this file's `form deck` collides with the live one and the two cannot coexist; the
# @term/base-backed variant is a base-integration decision, not a missing module.
note draft

load @term/base
  find deck

form deck, wear deck